    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This ontology documents bSDD (buildingSMART Data Dictionary) IFC 4.3 property IRIs. It does not re-publish or replace bSDD, it only provides lightweight annotations (labels/comments) for the referenced IRIs."
